# Committed production build configuration. Vite loads this automatically for
# `vite build`, so a host without dashboard environment variables still gets the
# right overlay endpoint. A local `.env` overrides it during development.
#
# This is the CARS shadow node. Browser overlay delivery is a write path only:
# reads still come from the derived public reader, and overlay failures never
# change an accepted wallet action.
